  "published": "2026-11-02T06:55:40.557Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fourth prerelease. Breaking: DetectedGame and SaveInfo are records with init properties, no longer positional (make them with { ... }); the host contract drops what no engine read: IHost.DeterministicTime, IInputDriver.GetMouseState, HeadlessInput.Mouse and GetMouseState, and MouseState. New: the NES release (the American cartridge, a .nes dump or its .prg), with its title screens, sound and own save screen; the Atari ST release, from its .st disk image; the Amiga release, from its two .adf disk images, with its own sound in stereo; the C64 demo; Palettes.Nes and Palettes.Amiga. Every release is won by the walkthrough tests, and its saves load in ScummVM 2026.4.0 and the other way round. Fixed: a save made with another release is refused, by name, before the world is touched; save errors are InvalidDataException; the MD5 lookup is built once whatever the thread. The maniacal tool plays every release, keeping their saves in maniac/nes, maniac/atari and maniac/amiga.",
